From 41e8016f1339c809cf9c2d0ce4d8ba1f347d80a4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 13:06:49 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(sessions): stored chat outcome, server-side mute,
 turn-end/reap refresh [daveey]

Every chat gets one stored outcome (sessions.outcome_json / outcome_at) and a
lineage-wide mute flag (sessions.muted). hermes_state_outcome declares, derives
(contract precedence 1-8: muted, live turn, open decisions, live work, a held
declaration, tail shape, summary judge/heuristic, empty) and refreshes it;
plugins add a judge and providers. Refreshed at every Desktop/TUI turn
conclusion, every messaging-platform turn end and on orphan reap.
List rows carry outcome + muted; POST /api/sessions/{id}/mute, GET
/api/sessions/{id}/outcome?refresh=1; hermes sessions mute|unmute|outcome|
outcome-audit.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
